# Backup schedule, run by supercronic. Times are in the container's TZ
# (America/Argentina/Buenos_Aires, set in deploy/compose.yml). Staggered from
# the other stacks on the Pi (finance-tracker backs up at 03:30).
#
# Nightly dump at 02:45, retention included.
45 2 * * * /usr/local/bin/entrypoint.sh backup
# Restore drill at 04:45 on the 2nd of every month.
45 4 2 * * /usr/local/bin/entrypoint.sh restore-drill
